# The store's embedding selection. `model-audience` completes the contract's
# `model` binding: the audience the authority knows the composed gateway by.
# The playground uses the real gateway through its Codefly-generated client and
# the authority hop. There is no fallback to synthetic vectors.
# No value here names what the store embeds in: at startup it asks the gateway
# for its one installed embedding profile (ListProfiles) and embeds one probe to
# read the space, and that answer is the label its index stores. No embedding
# profile, several, or a gateway that has not answered within 30 seconds refuses
# the binding by name; indexing waits and search is unavailable, while document
# read/write still serves.
# See ../README.md and modules/documents/docs/configuration.md.
model-audience=model
provider=installed
binding=model
endpoint=${endpoint:authority/hop/grpc}
